  "scope_notes": "The commit list includes commits from PR #34861, but the diff provided reflects only the changes on top of #34861.",
  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "Allows importing public-key-only descriptors into wallets with private keys enabled when the wallet already possesses the corresponding private keys. Previously, Bitcoin Core rejected public descriptors on privkey-enabled wallets, requiring private keys to be exported and re-passed in RPC calls. The wallet now scans its existing ScriptPubKeyMans for matching keys and substitutes origin-annotated xpubs with known master xprvs. Closes issue #27336.",
